  rl.2 Amos Stoltzfus|father|Expects spare wages toward the household and knows nothing of the barbell savings
  rl.3 Reuben Stoltzfus|younger brother, died 1980|Died at eleven; Noah remembers both affection and the burden of supervising him
  rl.4 Willie Bender|friend and lifting partner|Holds the club at his house and unknowingly appears in Noah's comic drawings
  rl.5 Becca Stoltzfus|cousin|Took the 1987 lake photograph and left her red swim cap in Noah's hand
